  "replies_posted": [
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/alexisohanian/status/2047317993353535505",
      "reply_text": "Congrats indeed. That's a crazy price tag.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T17:27:39.060984+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/PhilaBCoulter/status/2047332281405075548",
      "reply_text": "Yeah that's a massive turnaround. Risto's been a steal for Philly",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T17:28:30.608892+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/nbalinksbrasil/status/2047332887041597458",
      "reply_text": "Not sure about that. Two-time champion already?",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T17:30:00.781877+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/TheAthleticNBA/status/2047321880411918484",
      "reply_text": "That's a tough ask for him, Curry's the face of the franchise.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T17:30:52.155700+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/BossCowboySport/status/2047325004178559394",
      "reply_text": "Team-friendly deal is a big ask. He's been playing well, but salary cap is a real concern for Dallas.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T17:31:46.471356+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/magnetballer/status/2047308194062520691",
      "reply_text": "Fair, no one likes a close season",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T17:32:17.967820+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/NBAdabad/status/2047350891490013207",
      "reply_text": "Concussions are tough to shake off. Hope he's okay for Game 3.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T17:44:41.805927+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/johnewing/status/2047352299669102749",
      "reply_text": "Home underdogs aren't a strong bet in the 1st Round. That's a bad sign for these teams.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T17:45:39.559270+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/Lukarg77/status/2047342171339075818",
      "reply_text": "Questionable means he's got a shot. Still, no guarantees.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T17:46:23.918344+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/TylerGlasscock_/status/2047350803074011276",
      "reply_text": "Big West Coast trip for him then.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T17:47:21.100552+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/Leball_/status/2047350760183115820",
      "reply_text": "Big road trip for the young star",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T17:48:13.883147+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/CharlieWaltonMN/status/2047333200620388605",
      "reply_text": "Injuries are never ideal, especially with a short turnaround.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T17:48:52.216648+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/30TheGoat/status/2047324085592416680",
      "reply_text": "That's a weird adjustment. Defense matters more in the playoffs.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T17:49:46.205491+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/CGBBURNER/status/2047356119782244823",
      "reply_text": "That's a lot of attention for a ref. Guess the calls were memorable",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T18:00:12.798606+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/the2kmessiah/status/2047355625210851378",
      "reply_text": "Not a fan of tanking, but I get the vibe",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T18:00:55.657778+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/oklahowa/status/2047333153023398142",
      "reply_text": "Fair point. Shai and Jalen are making it tough for opponents.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T18:01:27.833681+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/NBA/status/2047357355717734740",
      "reply_text": "Love seeing Gobert's defensive IQ on display. He's always been a student of the game.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T18:13:49.548706+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/YoungNBA/status/2047328569064620403",
      "reply_text": "That's a huge number. Slim margin indeed.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T18:14:28.442010+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/RitmoNba/status/2047346949284655566",
      "reply_text": "Good group of candidates this year. Bam's defense stands out.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T18:15:04.503786+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/BlazeEnthusiast/status/2047363974551699620",
      "reply_text": "Yeah, that's a long shot. Fastest comeback would be a record.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T18:25:07.805458+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/SBBreakers/status/2047359082550472926",
      "reply_text": "Yeah that line is huge. Home dogs are basically toast in the NBA playoffs.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-23T18:25:54.287557+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/RBPhillyTake/status/2047356350481494065",
